        "en": "Shoppers appreciate the clean store layout, wide selection of pet food brands, and variety of toys available on the shelves. Several reviewers note that the store reliably stocks prescription and specialty diets recommended by vets. However, one visitor raised concerns about disease prevention in the aquarium section after observing unwell fish in retail tanks."
