        "en": "Customer opinions regarding store and salon staff are notably split. Several pet parents praise floor staff for helpful assistance and applaud dedicated salon stylists for their thorough care. In contrast, other reviewers report hostile encounters with store associates, citing rude service at the fish counters and abrupt disputes with salon personnel over pet handling."
