        "en": "Concerns over pet and aquarium welfare"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple reviewers express serious worries regarding animal care standards at the store. While one pet parent felt their large dogs were treated with great warmth during grooming, most feedback on this topic is critical. Customers recount allegations of rough pet handling in the grooming salon, pet injury, and poor maintenance of fish health within retail tanks."
      }
